msgctxt "372\t505"
msgid "I've grown too old for this.\\nFighting's a young man's game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "619\t792"
msgid "If you were any younger...\\nI'm not so sure I would've won."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1055\t1115"
msgid "But you did win."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1142\t1348"
msgid "So just like Tamiya asked...\\nI'll stay away from the kid. I promise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1362\t1422"
msgid "The kid?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1543\t1603"
msgid "Toma!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1662\t1716"
msgid "Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1717\t1835"
msgid "Did Minister Tamiya really ask you to come here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1836\t1888"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "1889\t1945"
msgid "But why?"
msgstr "Ma perché?"

msgctxt "1946\t2138"
msgid "Why would he put you through so much...\\njust to save me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2139\t2259"
msgid "Tamiya cares about you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2280\t2340"
msgid "He does?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "2360\t2420"
msgid "He does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2430\t2486"
msgid "But... why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2487\t2561"
msgid "I betrayed him, left for Mine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2562\t2753"
msgid "Tamiya would never lose faith in you\\nover something like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2758\t2941"
msgid "He admires just how devoted you are\\nto Okinawa. He told me as much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2959\t3140"
msgid ""
"And not only that. He thinks you'll\\nflourish into a great politician "
"someday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3407\t3467"
msgid "Minister..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3528\t3590"
msgid "Minister Tamiya..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3609\t3669"
msgid "I'm sorry."
msgstr "Mi dispiace."

msgctxt "3683\t3760"
msgid "I'm so sorry!"
msgstr "Mi dispiace tanto!"
